  "disposition": "Explicit historical source-tree aggregate retirement; no owner behavioral-equivalence or new execution claim.",
  "source_basis": "v0871_demo_common.sh unconditionally refuses sunset v1 workflow; lifecycle/environment/trace depend on it; aggregate suite invokes those before all children. D8 test names retired private tooling dispatcher.",
  "retired_assertions": "All four full original tests remain in archive: environment/lifecycle/trace/failure/resume/restart; D8 manifest/readme/ordering/privateCLI; D9-D12 manifest/quality/release; full WP13 file inventory.",
