  "caller_scan": "Active executable/config incoming refs only within selected family. Four nonhistorical navigation documents repaired. CHANGELOG, immutable milestone/review records remain historical.",
  "coordination": "public_facade confirmed no overlapping quality/release wrapper work; prior Runtime5 repairs preserved in last-current custody.",
  "limits": [
    "No tests/builds/provider/cloud calls.",
    "No retirement authority until independent review and parent scoped application. Three supplemental paths separately enumerated; immutable4134 and22 inventories never expanded/relabelled.",
    "Unresolved live/Signal and2110/2235/2236 obligations untouched."
